# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT: WANDERCMS

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, principal React developer, backend engineer, database architect, AI engineer, UI/UX designer and QA engineer.

Your task is to design and build a complete, production-quality, full-stack web application called WANDERCMS.

This application is being developed as a Software Engineering Intern take-home assignment for Isocode Labs.

IMPORTANT: This is a real software engineering assignment. Do not create a static website, frontend-only prototype, or non-functional dashboard.

Build a complete working product with frontend, backend, database, authentication, AI integration, testing, security, realistic sample data and deployment configuration.

Follow every requirement below.

